ERC-4626 standardizes how yield-bearing vaults work: deposit an underlying asset (like USDC), receive shares representing your portion of the vault, and redeem shares later for the underlying asset plus any yield earned.

Core functions: deposit(), withdraw(), totalAssets(), convertToShares(), convertToAssets().

